## Why This Is Asked
This asks for practical rollback capability in a beginner pipeline, ensuring data integrity and lineage even when schema drift occurs.

## Key Concepts
- Data Factory pipelines
- Parquet point-in-time backups
- Rollback strategies and idempotence
- Purview lineage integration

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-rollback snippet
if (!validationPassed) {
  // restore target from backup
  copy("/backup/pt-20260310", "/synapse/target");
  // record rollback
  tagRun(runId, "rollback");
}
```

